# Updater signing keys. These live in ~/.tauri and belong in GitHub Actions
# secrets, never in the repository. A private key committed here would let
# anyone sign an update that installs itself on every student's machine, and
# git history would keep it after the delete. Belt and braces: the real keys
# are already outside the tree.
*.key
*.key.pub
*updater*.password
.vite/
app/shots/
app/src-tauri/gen/schemas/
